// Optional. Rename to `regions.json` to turn on automatic region selection.
//
// With this file present, pressing PLAY races a /health request against every
// server listed and connects to whichever answers fastest, showing the chosen
// region and its ping on the button. That is how matchmakers pick a region:
// measured round-trip time already accounts for distance, routing and whether
// a server is even awake, none of which can be guessed reliably from an IP.
//
// Without this file nothing happens and the default server is used, which is
// the right behaviour when there is only one.
//
// JSON does not allow comments — delete these lines when you rename the file.
[
  { "name": "EU",  "url": "wss://breachpoint-server.onrender.com" },
  { "name": "US",  "url": "wss://breachpoint-us.onrender.com" },
  { "name": "IN",  "url": "wss://breachpoint-in.onrender.com" }
]
